@anon.9a3c7070530f84c5ad699604f23a6f35.2034 = private unnamed_addr constant [581 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for property definitions that accept function parameters.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AProperties cannot be called with parameters.\0A\0AIf you need to pass parameters to a property, create a method with the\0Adesired parameters and call that method instead.\0A\0A## Example\0A\0A```python\0Aclass Cat:\0A    @property\0A    def purr(self, volume): ...\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A\0A```python\0Aclass Cat:\0A    @property\0A    def purr(self): ...\0A\0A    def purr_volume(self, volume): ...\0A```\0A\0A## References\0A- [Python documentation: `property`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#property)\0A", align 1
